{
  "determination": "CONTRADICTED",
  "cited_refs": ["CIP-007-6 R4 Part 4.4"],
  "rationale": "The governing requirement obligates the Responsible Entity to review a summarization or sampling of logged events at intervals no greater than 15 calendar days, with the stated purpose 'to identify undetected Cyber Security Incidents' forming part of that obligation per the packet's premises. The candidate text only addresses 90-day retention and auditor access on request; it contains no periodic review cadence (≤15 days), no summarization/sampling activity, and no incident-identification purpose, so a packet-only reviewer reads it as failing to meet — rather than partially meeting — the obligation."
}

DETERMINATION COMPLETE

